Alpine RV64 rootfs helper
=========================

Default source:
  https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/latest-stable/releases/riscv64/latest-releases.yaml

Default APK repositories:
  https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/latest-stable/main/riscv64
  https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/latest-stable/community/riscv64

Generated files stay under:
  target/rootfs/alpine-rv64-qemu
  target/images/alpine-cache

Regenerate with:
  tools/images/fetch-alpine-rv64.sh
